t on gated originals. Left for room, all pinnable and rehearsed where tried. callmegrr 31B. p-e-w, sh0ck0r, JokeHer and BinxNet E4B. BinxNet 12B. yuna1126 E2B, whose live card names the instruct model where the inventory recorded the pretrained base. ScottzillaSystems/supergemma4-e4b-abliterated, admitted since the swapped-wrapper rule. lhca521 and tutuchen2000 Huihui 26B-A4B re-uploads, untried after two of that edit's re-uploads were refused. The remaining qat-unquantized copies (igorls, llmfan46, wnfldchen, eadx, liskasYR, prithivMLmods, xdavxd, smashingtags)."
